    "item_data_json": "{\"options\":{\"A\":\"“Client with a substance use disorder reports two episodes of nonprescribed substance use this week and asks to review available treatment supports.”\",\"B\":\"“Substance abuser relapsed twice this week but is finally asking for help, showing improved willingness to take responsibility for the problem.”\",\"C\":\"“Client had two dirty episodes this week and should demonstrate better compliance before additional treatment resources are offered.”\",\"D\":\"“Substance-use concerns were discussed, but specific use was omitted from the record to avoid documenting information that might stigmatize the client.”\"}}",
